{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t昂船洲一艘已泊岸船隻發生火警，消防接報到場救火。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n事發於今早近10時。消防處說，如市民受到隨風飄散的煙霧和異味影響，應盡量留在室內及關閉門窗，並保持鎮定。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：汪溟曦\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T04:19:04.624281+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":84,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T03:50:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T13:03:33.747799+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T04:17:37.657438+00:00","content_hash":"3e638a742f005a2bb98ba76a71d3f4f9b0f5ea039d79ce8768828cfe4903eb35","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}